  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC.  Measurements of transverse momentum (pT) spectra for charged Xi and Omega hyperon production at mid-rapidity in several centrality intervals for Pb-Pb collisions at sqrt(sNN) = 2.76 TeV recorded in 2010.  Mid-rapidity yields, integrated over pT, have also been determined, together with the enhancements with respect to pp collisions and the hyperon-to-pion production ratios\n\nUPDATE (09 JUNE 2014): corrections to Tables 12,13,14 according to PLB erratum.\n",
